    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use analyze as a full-round action to target 1 additional target, plus 1 target per 6 ranks in the associated skill you possess. The analyze check is rolled once, and applied to all targets. You can only apply an application to the original target of analyze, and not to the additional targets (unless they are scrutinized).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
